  "description": "Jin-Hyeok, who has spent his life living off of rich women, is left to rot in prison for three years after being convicted of fraud and theft. While getting used to his new life in prison, he's in danger of becoming somebody's prison bitch due to his pretty appearance. Seok-Jun, known to have been jailed for murder, appears and helps him out of a difficult situation. From then, Jin-Hyeok decides to stick close to him to protect himself... However, contrary to his perfect plan, Jin-Hyeok gives up his backside to Seok-Jun... ?!\n\n\"How the hell did I become like this?!\"\n\n(Source: Mr Blue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
